                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I came here after seeing so many review about their giant salmon sushi and I have to say it definitely made up to the expectations. We did wait for around 2 hours, but it was worth it because the sushi was definitely huge and filling. Apart from the sushi the other menus are pretty average, I would recommend the salmon sushi the most. Tables are quite close to one another, so you might have a little trouble having conversations in busy hours.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
